      "depth": 4,
      "exam_styles": [
        "jee-main"
      ],
      "stem": {
        "en": "If $\\alpha=\\int_0^{2\\sqrt3}\\log_2\\left(x^2+4\\right)dx+\\int_2^4\\sqrt{2^x-4}\\,dx$, then $\\alpha^2$ is equal to ______.",
        "hi": "यदि $\\alpha=\\int_0^{2\\sqrt3}\\log_2\\left(x^2+4\\right)dx+\\int_2^4\\sqrt{2^x-4}\\,dx$ है, तो $\\alpha^2$ बराबर ______ है।"
      },
      "answer": {
        "value": 192,
        "unit": null
      },
      "solution": {
        "feynman": {
          "en": "The two integrands are inverse functions of each other: $y=\\log_2(x^2+4)$ gives $x=\\sqrt{2^y-4}$. The two areas fill a rectangle exactly.",
          "hi": "दोनों समाकल्य एक-दूसरे के प्रतिलोम फलन हैं: $y=\\log_2(x^2+4)$ से $x=\\sqrt{2^y-4}$। दोनों क्षेत्रफल मिलकर ठीक एक आयत भरते हैं।"
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "en": "$f(x)=\\log_2\\left(x^2+4\\right)$ rises from $f(0)=2$ to $f\\left(2\\sqrt3\\right)=4$, and $f^{-1}(y)=\\sqrt{2^y-4}$.",
            "hi": "$f(x)=\\log_2\\left(x^2+4\\right)$, $f(0)=2$ से $f\\left(2\\sqrt3\\right)=4$ तक बढ़ता है, और $f^{-1}(y)=\\sqrt{2^y-4}$।"
          },
          {
            "en": "$\\int_0^{b}f+\\int_{f(0)}^{f(b)}f^{-1}=b\\,f(b)-0 \\cdot f(0)=2\\sqrt3 \\times 4=8\\sqrt3$.",
            "hi": "$\\int_0^{b}f+\\int_{f(0)}^{f(b)}f^{-1}=b\\,f(b)-0 \\cdot f(0)=2\\sqrt3 \\times 4=8\\sqrt3$।"
          },
          {
            "en": "$\\alpha^2=192$.",
            "hi": "$\\alpha^2=192$।"
          }
        ],
